# Lines beginning with '#' (after optional leading whitespace) and blank
# lines are ignored. Each pattern is matched with `grep -E` against a
# single candidate email address.
#
# DO NOT add the repository owner's real personal email address to this
# file, in any form, for any reason. See .githooks/README.md.

# The one permitted identity: the owner's GitHub-generated noreply address
